  Description: You have an incredibly strong connection to the vitality energy that
    flows through the First World, making it harder to attack your life force with
    void energy. You gain void resistance equal to half your level (minimum 1). When
    you have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Doomed] condition, the
    condition affects you as if its value was 1 lower than it actually is (doomed
    1 has no effect, doomed 2 causes you to die at Dying 3, and so on).
